<title>UK: American Standard Co Inc prices share offering.</title>
<headline>American Standard Co Inc prices share offering.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Standard Companies Inc has priced an offering of 10,803,303 shares at $45.0 per share, lead manager Goldman Sachs said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The total offering has been increased from 10,750,000 shares with 2,161,661 shares being offered internationally</p>
<p>Kelso ASI Partners, the selling stockholder is selling the shares and American Standard will repurchase 6,250,000 shares from Kelso ASI at the same price.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley, SBC Warburg and Smith Barney are co-lead managers. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7970</p>
